        "Source kind dispatched at runtime by CallService. Recognised types: 'api' (default HTTP), 'database' (DB query), 'file' (filesystem), 'soap' (SOAPService dispatch), 'dso' (Digitaal Stelsel Omgevingswet outbound status/besluit. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by DsoIngestService via the DsoConnectorProviderInterface seam. Not via CallService; inbound Verzoek receipt is a signed webhook, DSOController::receiveRequest(), independent of this source's configuration), 'peppol' (Peppol Access Point, dispatched directly by PeppolTransmissionService. Not via CallService), 'psd2' (PSD2 AIS aggregator, dispatched directly by BankfeedSyncService. Not via CallService), 'sms' (SMS channel. NotifyNL or sandbox, dispatched directly by SmsDispatchService. Not via CallService), 'payment' (live payment provider. Log/sandbox or Mollie. Dispatched directly by PaymentIntentService, not via CallService), 'kiss' (KISS / VNG Klantinteracties API. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by KissSyncService. Not via CallService), 'open-formulieren' (Open Formulieren inbound webhook signature config, verified directly by OpenFormulierenController::inbound(). Not via CallService), 'iwmo-ijw' (iWMO/iJW StUF iStandaarden Wmo/Jeugdwet bridge. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by IwmoIjwSyncService. Not via CallService), 'fsc' (FSC / Federatieve Service Connectiviteit directory + call routing. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by FscCallService. Not via CallService). Free-form to keep custom adapter types unblocked; CallService falls back to HTTP for unrecognised values.": "Source kind dispatched at runtime by CallService. Recognised types: 'api' (default HTTP), 'database' (DB query), 'file' (filesystem), 'soap' (SOAPService dispatch), 'dso' (Digitaal Stelsel Omgevingswet outbound status/besluit. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by DsoIngestService via the DsoConnectorProviderInterface seam. Not via CallService; inbound Verzoek receipt is a signed webhook, DSOController::receiveRequest(), independent of this source's configuration), 'peppol' (Peppol Access Point, dispatched directly by PeppolTransmissionService. Not via CallService), 'psd2' (PSD2 AIS aggregator, dispatched directly by BankfeedSyncService. Not via CallService), 'sms' (SMS channel. NotifyNL or sandbox, dispatched directly by SmsDispatchService. Not via CallService), 'payment' (live payment provider. Log/sandbox or Mollie. Dispatched directly by PaymentIntentService, not via CallService), 'kiss' (KISS / VNG Klantinteracties API. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by KissSyncService. Not via CallService), 'open-formulieren' (Open Formulieren inbound webhook signature config, verified directly by OpenFormulierenController::inbound(). Not via CallService), 'iwmo-ijw' (iWMO/iJW StUF iStandaarden Wmo/Jeugdwet bridge. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by IwmoIjwSyncService. Not via CallService), 'fsc' (FSC / Federatieve Service Connectiviteit directory + call routing. Log/sandbox or generic REST, dispatched directly by FscCallService. Not via CallService). Free-form to keep custom adapter types unblocked; CallService falls back to HTTP for unrecognised values.",
